                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <DIV class=Section1 style="LAYOUT-GRID:  15.6pt none">
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">关于第二批“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”申报工作的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                      </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">浙教基函〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>48</SPAN>号<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">各市、县（市、区）教育局基教处（德育处）：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">为贯彻落实党的十九大精神和教育部《中小学德育工作指南》文件要求，探索新形势下班主任队伍建设的新途径、新方法，推进班主任队伍专业化发展，根据浙江省教育学会德育分会制订的《浙江省中小学班主任工作室规程》要求，决定开展首批<SPAN lang=EN-US>101</SPAN>个“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”复评工作和第二批“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”申报工作，现将具体事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">第二批“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”申报<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">（一）工作目标<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">遵循公开透明、客观公正、科学有效的原则，在全省范围内遴选一批思想素质好、业务水平高、奉献精神强、有实践经验和研究成果的浙江省中小学班主任工作研究带头人，建立“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”（以下简称“工作室”），带领中青年班主任骨干破解新时期班主任工作中的重点、难点问题，探索班主任专业化发展的多元机制。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">（二）申报条件<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">各中小学校要根据《浙江省中小学班主任工作室规程》中第二章“工作室申报”的规定进行申报。具体条件如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．工作室领衔人具有较高的政治思想素质和职业道德素养，有先进的教育理念和改革创新意识，有较强的教育研究能力和实践能力，能模范履行班主任职责；<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．工作室领衔人具备<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>年及以上班主任工作经历，具有中学高级及以上职称的在职在岗班主任，具有省级及以上综合荣誉等特别优秀教师可适当放宽条件；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．工作室领衔人在建班育人的过程中已经形成较鲜明的工作特色，在省内具有一定的知名度和影响力；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．近<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>年来，工作室领衔人至少主持过<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>项区、县（市）级及以上研究课题，或有<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>篇及以上的德育类论文（成果）在公开刊物上发表或市级以上获奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">（三）遴选办法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">．工作室申报采取</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">个人自荐、专家举荐、<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">单位推荐形式，工作室领衔人要认真填写《浙江省中小学班主任工作室申报表》，表格一式<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>份，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">由申报人所在单位盖章后，报送各县（市、区）教育局，并由县（市、区）教育局报设区市教育局统筹确定上报省德育分会名单。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">．各设区市教育局按照申报条件要求，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">严格把关，确定推荐名单（各设区市推荐名额不超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>个），审核同意盖章后，于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日前将申报材料纸质稿和电子稿报送至浙江省教育学会德育分会秘书处。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">．浙江省教育学会德育分会将组织专家对工作室领衔人的申报材料进行初评，初评通过的要参加现场答辩（具体时间、地点另行通知），最终确定<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>个“浙江省第二批中小学班主任工作室”，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">评审结果在网上公示一周通过后，正式命名第二批 “浙江省中小学班主任工作室”，有效期三年。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">附件：<SPAN lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN>浙江省中小学班主任工作室复评基本情况填报表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 48pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">首批<SPAN lang=EN-US>101</SPAN>个“浙江省中小学班主任工作室”名单<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 48pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">浙江省中小学班主任工作室申报表<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
